.SH NAME
le-check - HTTP health-check a listener (status + latency + curl)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBle check PORT [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Check literal IPv4/IPv6 loopback and report status, timing and a curl command.
HTTPS development certificates are diagnostic-only. The complete check has
a five-second deadline and a 32 KiB aggregate response-header limit.
Redirects, proxies and cookies are not used; response bodies are not retained.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for check


